 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=htNu6knZxw0Q7kNvwE15GDF&_nc_oc=AdrzGwNpWG5kVoMcwIKPLZJnGXPCHFFHV_1ly-OpH06celCp5sL6Gpfu54UfwI9mJ-A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdQ2KdzHhrCgJBkQr2PNhwb1Bsso7Vydm1jvWIDDS65Q&oe=6B09B963"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dXrKtTHka8Q7kNvwHhop65&_nc_oc=AdrSNhLuLIwru-r_2dHVAMas5xwUb4bNRtznWzVUALmH82c01E0fMGO8hw0ZRJBwB94&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRrwUiLVAINm6vbcmD1q7XFlTsW2Hlgho6BH9T_9FK_FA&oe=6B09A55D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vHQl-5E9xEYQ7kNvwGJlnvr&_nc_oc=AdohZ4vIKD2M4SKraiLKbMrPcuDi7mjd4w27ZNpVDA8PtXNwrOwOj3_Z1tVj4eh-Erk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRh6fHRsa04D9Pje5QaeHpjGs